msgid "Map replay"
msgstr "lukin sin pi lipu ma"

msgid "The map is zoomed out to show its full extent. Ownership and city locations update as the turns play."
msgstr "lipu ma li lili tawa ni: sina ken lukin e ma ale. tenpo musi li tawa la jan pi ma en ma tomo li ante."

msgid "Start replay"
msgstr "o open e lukin sin"

msgid "Return to game"
msgstr "o tawa musi"

msgid "Turn %d of %d"
msgstr "tenpo musi %d tan %d"

msgid "Close replay"
msgstr "o pini e lukin sin"

msgid "Turn %d / %d"
msgstr "tenpo musi %d / %d"

msgid "Saved on this PC between sessions"
msgstr "ni li awen lon ilo ni lon tenpo pi musi ala"

msgid "Move the table..."
msgstr "o tawa e supa..."

msgid "Back to the middle"
msgstr "o tawa insa sin"

msgid "Your controllers"
msgstr "ilo luka sina"

msgid "Show button labels"
msgstr "o pana e nimi nena"

msgid "Floating labels beside each controller saying what its buttons do right now."
msgstr "nimi li lon poka pi ilo luka li toki e pali nena lon tenpo ni."

msgid "The right trigger clicks when you let go of it, so holding it to zoom doesn't click anything."
msgstr "sina weka e luka tan nena sinpin pi ilo luka teje la ona li pali. ni la sina luka awen e ona tawa suli lukin la ona li anu ala e ijo."

