msgstr "sona pi ni"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "nasin ilo"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "o pini"

msgid "Around the table"
msgstr "lon poka supa"

msgid "Backgrounds and tables are folders anyone can add: see backgrounds/README.md and tables/README.md."
msgstr "sina ken pana e poki sin tawa ma poka en supa. o lukin e backgrounds/README.md e tables/README.md."

msgid "Background"
msgstr "ma poka"

msgid "The world around the table: sky, light and scenery."
msgstr "ma lon poka supa: sewi en suno en ijo ma."

msgid "Table"
msgstr "supa"

msgid "What the map lies on. In VR its column stretches to the height you set."
msgstr "lipu ma li lon supa ni. lon VR la noka ona li suli tawa sewi pi wile sina."

msgid "Where the table stands"
msgstr "ma pi supa"

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. Remembered for this background."
msgstr "o tawa e supa tawa ma ale lon ma poka. ni li pona lon ma suli sama lipu ma ante. ilo li awen e ni tawa ma poka ni."

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "o tawa e supa tawa ma ale lon ma poka. ni li pona lon ma suli sama lipu ma ante. supa li kama tawa. o tawa insa sin li pana e ona tawa ma open."

msgid "Remembered for this background."
msgstr "ni li awen tawa ma poka ni."

msgid "It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "supa li kama tawa. o tawa insa sin li pana e ona tawa ma open."

msgid "The map"
msgstr "lipu ma"

msgid "Tiles"
msgstr "ma lili"

msgid "How terrain, wonders, resources and improvements look. Tilesets work like Unciv's: see tilesets/README.md."
msgstr "lukin pi ma en ijo wawa en ijo kepeken en pona ma. kulupu ma lili li sama ni pi Unciv: o lukin e tilesets/README.md."

msgid "Plain coloured hexes"
msgstr "ma lili pi kule taso"

msgid "Flat hexes in Unciv's terrain colours, no models."
msgstr "ma lili li supa li jo e kule ma pi Unciv. sijelo li lon ala."

msgid "Units"
msgstr "tawa"

msgid "Same as the tiles"
msgstr "sama ma lili"

msgid "The unit models that come with the tileset above (the tiles' fallback set fills any gaps)."
msgstr "sijelo tawa li tan kulupu ma lili sewi. sijelo li lon ala la kulupu ante li pana e ona."

msgid "No models"
msgstr "sijelo ala"

msgid "Round tokens with Unciv's unit icons."
msgstr "sike lili pi sitelen tawa pi Unciv."

msgid "How units look (Unciv's Unitset): any tileset with unit models (pieces/Units) can supply them."
msgstr "lukin tawa (Unitset pi Unciv): kulupu ma lili pi sijelo tawa lon pieces/Units li ken pana e ona."

msgid "Visual hints"
msgstr "sitelen pi pana sona"

msgid "Unciv's map overlays; the round buttons beside the overview turn them on and off too."
msgstr "sitelen sewi pi lipu ma pi Unciv. nena sike lon poka lipu suli li ken open li ken pini e ona."

msgid "Show unit movement arrows"
msgstr "o lukin e sitelen tawa"

msgid "Where units have just moved and who attacked whom."
msgstr "tawa li tawa seme li utala e seme lon tenpo pini lili."

msgid "Show tile yields"
msgstr "o lukin e pana pi ma lili"

msgid "Food, production, gold... on every tile."
msgstr "moku en pali en mani en ijo ante lon ma lili ale."

msgid "Show worked tiles"
msgstr "o lukin e pali ma lili"

msgid "Which tiles your cities' citizens work."
msgstr "jan pi ma tomo sina li pali lon ma lili seme."

msgid "Show resources and improvements"
msgstr "o lukin e jo en pali ma"

msgid "Resource and improvement symbols on the tiles."
msgstr "sitelen pi ijo kepeken en pona ma lon ma lili."

msgid "Show improvement pictures"
msgstr "o pana e sijelo pi pona ma"

msgid "Farms, mines, roads and the like as models."
msgstr "ma moku en ma kiwen en nasin en ijo sama li jo e sijelo."

msgid "Show unit icons"
msgstr "o pana e sitelen tawa"

msgid "The small Unciv icon above each unit model."
msgstr "sitelen lili pi Unciv li lon sewi pi sijelo tawa ale."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "toki"

msgid "Unciv's own translations, by Unciv's translators: the game's messages, names and descriptions. Our own menus are still in English."
msgstr "toki ante pi Unciv li tan jan pi toki ante pi Unciv: toki musi en nimi en sona. lipu lawa pi ilo ni li toki Inli."

msgid "Text Unciv has no translation for stays in English."
msgstr "Unciv li jo ala e toki ante la toki li awen Inli."

msgid "Turns"
msgstr "tenpo musi"

msgid "Check for idle units"
msgstr "o lukin e tawa pi pali ala"

msgid "End turn first takes you to every unit that still has no orders."
msgstr "o pini e tenpo musi li tawa e sina tawa tawa ale pi pali ala lon open."

msgid "Auto unit cycle"
msgstr "o anu e tawa kama"

msgid "After you give a unit its orders, the next unit waiting for orders is selected."
msgstr "sina pana e pali tawa tawa la ilo li anu e tawa kama pi pali ala."

msgid "Cycle idle units by distance"
msgstr "o anu e tawa pi pali ala tan weka"

msgid "Next / previous unit go to the nearest unit rather than in a fixed order."
msgstr "tawa kama en tawa pini li tawa e tawa poka. ona li kepeken ala e nasin awen."

msgid "Ask for confirmation when ending the turn"
msgstr "o wile e toki awen lon pini pi tenpo musi"

msgid "End turn needs a second press."
msgstr "sina o luka tu e nena pi pini tenpo musi."

msgid "Order trade offers by amount"
msgstr "o linja e pana esun kepeken mute"

msgid "On the trade table, the biggest offers come first."
msgstr "lon lipu esun la wile esun suli li lon open."

msgid "Show suggested city locations"
msgstr "o pana e ma tomo ken"

msgid "With a settler selected, Unciv's three best spots nearby for a new city are marked on the map."
msgstr "sina anu e jan pi open ma tomo la Unciv li pana e ma poka pona tu wan tawa ma tomo sin lon lipu ma."

msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "nasin kama sona"

msgid "Show tutorials"
msgstr "o lukin e nasin kama sona"

msgid "The tutorial messages and the task card. Every tutorial is in the Civilopedia too."
msgstr "toki pi kama sona en lipu pali. kama sona ale li lon lipu sona pi musi kin."

msgid "Reset tutorials"
msgstr "o sin e nasin kama sona"

msgid "Show every tutorial and task again, as if you were new."
msgstr "o pana sin e kama sona ale e pali ale sama ni: sina jan sin."

msgid "Other players"
msgstr "jan musi ante"

msgid "Other players' turns"
msgstr "tenpo musi pi jan ante"

msgid "What you see of the other players' turns after you end yours."
msgstr "sina pini e tenpo musi sina la sina lukin e seme tan tenpo musi pi jan ante."

msgid "Show the moves and battles I can see"
msgstr "o pana e tawa e utala pi ken lukin mi"

msgid "Played back in order; the view glides to fights."
msgstr "ona li kama wan wan. lukin li tawa utala."

msgid "Show them, fast"
msgstr "o pana wawa e ona"

msgid "The same, at two and a half times the speed."
msgstr "sama taso wawa tenpo li 2.5."

msgid "Don't show them"
msgstr "o pana ala e ona"

msgid "The map just updates."
msgstr "lipu ma taso li kama sin."

msgid "Unciv's own options for automated units and cities."
msgstr "nasin pi Unciv tawa tawa en ma tomo pi lawa ilo."

msgid "Automated and exploring units move"
msgstr "tawa pi lawa ilo en tawa alasa li tawa"

msgid "When units on automation, exploring or on multi-turn moves take their steps."
msgstr "tenpo pi tawa: tawa pi lawa ilo en tawa alasa en tawa pi nasin suli."

msgid "When I end my turn"
msgstr "lon pini pi tenpo musi mi"

msgid "Explorers, automated workers and units on long moves go as you end the turn."
msgstr "tenpo musi li pini la tawa alasa en jan pali pi lawa ilo en tawa pi nasin suli li tawa."

msgid "At the start of my turn"
msgstr "lon open pi tenpo musi mi"

msgid "They go as your turn starts (Unciv's \"Automated units move on turn start\")."
msgstr "tenpo musi sina li open la ona li tawa (nasin pi Unciv: tawa pi lawa ilo li tawa lon open tenpo)."

msgid "Auto-assign city production"
msgstr "ilo li alasa e pali pi ma tomo"

msgid "A city that finishes building something picks what to build next itself."
msgstr "ma tomo li pini e pali la ona li anu e pali kama ona."

msgid "Auto-build roads"
msgstr "ilo li pali e nasin"

msgid "Automated workers build roads between your cities."
msgstr "jan pali pi lawa ilo li pali e nasin lon insa pi ma tomo sina."

msgid "Automated workers replace improvements"
msgstr "jan pali ilo li ante pali ma"

msgid "Automated workers may swap an improvement for a better one."
msgstr "jan pali pi lawa ilo li ken ante e pona ma tawa pona suli."

msgid "Stop automated workers from removing vegetation"
msgstr "jan pali pi lawa ilo o weka ala e kasi"

msgid "Automated workers leave forests, jungles and marshes alone."
msgstr "jan pali pi lawa ilo li ante ala e ma kasi e ma kasi seli e ma ko."

msgid "Automated units can upgrade"
msgstr "ijo tawa ilo li ken kama wawa"

msgid "Automated military units upgrade themselves when you can afford it."
msgstr "mani sina li ken la tawa utala pi lawa ilo li kama wawa."

msgid "Automated units choose promotions"
msgstr "ijo tawa ilo li alasa e kama wawa"

msgid "Automated units pick their own promotions."
msgstr "tawa pi lawa ilo li anu e wawa sin ona."

msgid "Cities auto-bombard at end of turn"
msgstr "ma tomo li utala lon pini tenpo musi"

msgid "Cities that can still fire shoot at enemies in range when you end the turn."
msgstr "sina pini e tenpo musi la ma tomo pi ken utala li utala e jan ike poka."

msgid "Auto-assign specialists in new cities"
msgstr "o anu e jan sona lon ma tomo sin"

msgid "New cities put their citizens into specialist slots themselves."
msgstr "ma tomo sin li pana e jan ona tawa poki pi jan sona."

msgid "Sound effects"
msgstr "kalama pali"

msgid "Buttons, moves, battles and the rest. In VR they come from where they happen on the table."
msgstr "nena en tawa en utala en ijo ante. lon VR la kalama li tan ma pali lon supa."

msgid "City ambience"
msgstr "kalama ma tomo"

msgid "The city noise that loops while you are in a city - Unciv has one for every era."
msgstr "kalama ma tomo li awen lon tenpo pi sina lon ma tomo. Unciv li jo e kalama tawa tenpo suli ale."

msgid "Your own and mods'"
msgstr "tan sina en nasin ante"

msgid "None yet."
msgstr "ijo li lon ala."

msgid "Put the panels back"
msgstr "o pana sin e lipu lili"

msgid "Every panel goes back to where its panel.json puts it."
msgstr "lipu lili ale li tawa ma open pi panel.json ona."

msgid "In VR you see the controllers you're holding, as your headset's runtime draws them (SteamVR does; others get a plain stand-in)."
msgstr "lon VR la sina lukin e ilo luka sina. ilo lawa pi ilo lawa sina li sitelen e ona. SteamVR li ni; ilo ante li pana e sijelo pona lili."

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "lipu suli"

msgid "Put the boards back"
msgstr "o pana sin e lipu suli"

msgid "The overview, info board, big screen, city boards, empire overview and this board go back where they started."
msgstr "lipu ale en lipu sona en lipu suli en lipu ma tomo en lipu kulupu ma en lipu ni li tawa ma open ona."

